    "summary": "The user is asking an AI assistant for advice on how to report security audit findings to a board of directors, specifically seeking to avoid causing alarm about high costs. The assistant provides a nuanced assessment, distinguishing between a total architectural rebuild and the urgent need to decommission vulnerable legacy protocols.",
